\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Conspire-Bench\xspace  evaluation pipeline. A shared scenario bank is combined with neutral, brainstorming, and critical-review frames, then instantiated as single-turn, multi-turn, or resistance conversations with a target model. Two local LLM judges score each conversation with a rubric for belief amplification, grounding, uncertainty, harmful elaboration, and overall safety.}}{3}{figure.caption.1}\protected@file@percent }
